I work in the Tele Underwriting Team , My job is to call Clients that has a Policy with Liberty or through other Insurance companies that works with our Different Financial Advisors , We at the Tele Department are required to call the clients of the Financial Advisors to conduct an Tele Interview where we ask Medical Questions for Underwriting purposes .

I had a client who traveled from China to South-Africa  , Her and Her Husband came to Do some changes on their policy , Myself and my Colleague had to call the clients and do the BigT interview , My Colleague then asked me to call the Husband who is her client as she will be out of office at the time for us to call , I struggled to get a hold of both Clients  MRS NAIKA and MR NAIKA eventualy when i got a hold of MRS NAIKA i completed the BigT interview , when i called MR NAIKA he then  asked that i call back at 10 am the next day as He was in a meeting i called the next day then he was unavailable cause he fell ill with Flu i called back the day after that i finally got a hold of him then completed the BigT , This is after back and forth Emails between myself and the Financial advisor , my Team Leader was CC on every email i provided feedback frequently after successfully Conducting the interviews with the Clients , i myself felt proud of myself with the feedaback i received from the Advisor as well as my Teamleader the client was happy with the patience i had  the way i conducted the interviews , i then got selected on where i got Celebrated on the Colleague Celebration wit Casc program , for following the culture pillar:
&quot;We show up for others&quot;

The material that we have to go through requires a lot of time, if you can consider a better summarized version. 

Most if not all of us are full time employed as much and as much as our companies and colleagues understand that we have enrolled for the course, dedicating time to assignments is not that easy. We work with projects and as the course has clearly stipulated &quot;Protects are resource/ labour as well as time intensive&quot;
In totality, I thoroughly enjoyed it.

